{
  "description": "🎛️ The declaration rules of the schema-mutation-input-ui gate (design §22.8), one planted case per rule next to the inputs each rule leaves alone: interactive numbers with and without step or snapping points (own annotation, $ref target, inherited by array items, the numeric transport, a reference, a hidden input, a vector, a non-number widget), labels declared in every locale, in one locale with and without a glossary row, through the glossary alone (counted, never refused) and not at all, a root union's selector, a widget outside the strict vocabulary, multiline inputs with and without the multi-line control, editable leaves that show no input (none at all, every one hidden), and a withdraw-only leaf whose inputs no rule judges.",
